  "question": {
    "text": "When the following aldohexose exists in Pyranose form, the total number of stereoisomers in its pyranose form is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0069_cdf31a7a8068.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 199px;\" /><br /><br />Pyranose form is cyclic structure containing four chiral atoms.<br /><br />Hence number of stereoisomers <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>"
  }
